WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:08.712
First, ask: "Who will be doing my hair and makeup on the day?"

2
00:00:09.048 --> 00:00:12.192
With wedding-parent makeup, who does it is everything.

3
00:00:12.528 --> 00:00:19.080
Wouldn't you rather have an experienced head artist with a good eye handle your makeup and hair?

4
00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:24.792
Sometimes the head artist does the consultation, but someone entirely different handles you on the actual day.

5
00:00:25.128 --> 00:00:33.192
On busy weekend wedding days especially, outside or temporary staff often get called in, so be sure to confirm who will actually be doing your makeup.

6
00:00:33.528 --> 00:00:37.128
And on the wedding day, confirm it's actually that same person.

7
00:00:37.464 --> 00:00:41.808
With wedding-parent makeup, a difference in experience shows up directly in the result.

8
00:00:42.144 --> 00:00:47.256
For a wedding day with no regrets, always check who's doing your makeup.

9
00:00:47.592 --> 00:00:52.248
Second, ask: "Do you offer a one-on-one pre-consultation?"

10
00:00:52.584 --> 00:00:55.512
Meeting for the first time on the day and being asked, "How would you like it done?"

11
00:00:55.848 --> 00:01:06.552
is a completely different starting point from having your face shape, skin tone, best hairstyle, hanbok color, and desired look all worked out in advance.

12
00:01:06.888 --> 00:01:09.336
Every parent has different concerns.

13
00:01:09.672 --> 00:01:16.800
Some worry their face will look too big, some worry about droopy eyes, and some worry that thin hair will make them look shabby.

14
00:01:17.136 --> 00:01:20.568
These aren't things a few words on the day can fix.

15
00:01:20.904 --> 00:01:25.488
In the end, choosing well isn't about how famous the shop is.

16
00:01:25.824 --> 00:01:32.184
What matters is how well they understand you, who's in charge, and whether there's a proper consultation and preparation process.

17
00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:37.968
On the wedding day, the parents represent their family and greet guests — they're the dignified face of the ceremony.

18
00:01:38.304 --> 00:01:43.320
To be a satisfied wedding parent on this precious day, be sure to ask these two questions.

19
00:01:43.656 --> 00:01:49.728
There are other things to check too, but these are the essential questions for wedding-parent makeup you won't regret.
